000300* PERFORM A THRU C while B performs C: a common exit. Each
000400* PERFORM keeps what the exit cell held and puts it back, as
000500* IKFCBL00's does, so the inner return does not lose the outer
000600* one (#35). Also PERFORM n TIMES with n past a halfword.
000700* Expected output recorded from IBM ANS COBOL on TK5.
